   "id": "seg-01",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "A big idea comes up. We open a discussion first. I suggest that we check the AI model first. The result depends on the prompt, so I check it twice. I explain GitHub Discussion to a new teammate. We discuss the risk around the request for comments. Before we move on, Priya says, \"I'm not completely sure.\" I build a full answer around the pattern: As far as I know ... The team agrees on the plan, and I record the decision.",
   "tts": "A big idea comes up. We open a discussion first. I suggest that we check the A I model first. The result depends on the prompt, so I check it twice. I explain Git Hub Discussion to a new teammate. We discuss the risk around the request for comments. Before we move on, Priya says, \"I'm not completely sure.\" I build a full answer around the pattern: As far as I know  The team agrees on the plan, and I record the decision.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-01.mp3",
   "zh": "一个大想法出现了。我们先开了一个讨论。我建议我们先检查AI 模型。结果取决于提示词，所以我检查了两遍。我向一位新队友解释了GitHub 讨论区。我们讨论了征求意见稿相关的风险。继续之前，Priya说：\"我不是完全确定。\"我围绕这个句型组织了一个完整的回答：据我所知……团队就计划达成一致，我记录了决定。",
