  {
   "id": "seg-02",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "I am not completely sure, and I say so. The pattern helps me sound clear and calm: It seems likely that ... Before we move on, Priya says, \"I may be mistaken.\" I explain the context window to a new teammate. We discuss the risk around the system instruction. I document the design proposal so the team can review it later. If the open question fails, we need a clear plan. The day ends with a clear plan for tomorrow.",
   "tts": "I am not completely sure, and I say so. The pattern helps me sound clear and calm: It seems likely that  Before we move on, Priya says, \"I may be mistaken.\" I explain the context window to a new teammate. We discuss the risk around the system instruction. I document the design proposal so the team can review it later. If the open question fails, we need a clear plan. The day ends with a clear plan for tomorrow.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-02.mp3",
   "zh": "我不是完全确定，我如实说了。这个句型让我听起来清楚又从容：看起来很可能……继续之前，Priya说：\"我可能弄错了。\"我向一位新队友解释了上下文窗口。我们讨论了系统指令相关的风险。我把设计提案写成文档，方便团队之后查看。如果开放问题失败，我们需要一个清晰的方案。这一天以一份清晰的明日计划结束。",
