   "en": "Before I leave, I write a short summary for the team. I suggest that we check the decision record first. The result depends on the technical discussion, so I check it twice. I explain the user message to a new teammate. We discuss the risk around the model response. At the end of the day, Maria says, \"Let me check first.\" I reply, \"The evidence is limited.\" The discussion becomes a decision record. We build next week.",
